      {
        "id": "book029-b000934-p000-a0bf7f26e7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "穴倚中撞葬法为蚌垒：伏脉的枝节如同眠木，形态细小、低矮、横卧且隐伏，在其瘦削之处下针；若像被剖开的竹子难以在中腰安穴，小梗枝微微隆起，就选择对乐、横枕的位置扦穴；若要讨乐、黄枕的位置，也可在此扦穴。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b000935-p000-e81531a672",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "穴撞中倚塟的方法为燕窠坐：流木撞节处的水星推出眠木，盖处瘦长且孤露，观察其阳面牵出的突泡处来扦穴。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b000936-p000-c739951123",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "穴倚中穿法为啣珠照天蜡烛：四周山峦高起，内局逼仄，后龙童峙，跌断一线后接连耸起高峰，峰顶开阔平坦，四周水流倾泻，精气上聚，就选择峰顶扦穴。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b000938-p000-72fccb4faa",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "穴正盖塟法为抄手捧盆。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b000939-p000-f54d2e07d9",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "卷地木星分两枝，来龙帷雄交度，需审察其水神迎未就去、相对的位置来安坟。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b000940-p000-36b3754602",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "穴法缀葬法：来处为箕口，去处为捧盆。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b000941-p000-d774794c0e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "直起的木星、直起的星辰中乳，从秀顶穿落，看似美观但煞气重；左股从水下行有端，应在左处扦穴。",
